I guess you haven't learned enough of about nethack yet.  School's in:
SPOILER ALERT

1) If you get hit by a nurse when you are wearing no armor or weilding no
   weapon, you gain hit points, even permanent ones.

2) I don't know if this is true in 3.0j but in some version of nethack,
   drinking a potion of extra healing when you already have maximum hit
   points will increase you hit points by 2.

3) In some version of nethack 3.0 if you were below some number of hit
   points, and you were in good standing with your deity, and you prayed,
   you usually got healed, plus 5 more permanent hit points.

The best method is the first.  Especially if you read a cursed scroll of
genocide, and then choose to genocide nurses.

